  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Have dissectors reduce rather than expand the protocol item length",
  "description": "Analysis engines like MATE depend on dissectors which are uncertain\nof their PDU length up front to first declare the protocol item to\nspan the entire TVB, then at a later stage reduce their TVB scope.\n\nWith this change a few remaining dissectors not following this pattern\nare adjusted to work like this.",
