        {
          "id": 2975533728,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "It was a while ago, when I was working on some aspects of the functionality in proto.c. I knew the problem with this pattern (zero offset, zero length) and was probably grepping for it. So could I have missed others? Certainly. Does this cause problems? Not yet apparently, for years already. So we can respond to them when the time comes (i.e., an issue is filed). These six we can already strike from that list.",
