      "parent_ids": [
        "d124e488b418acc2482fa2ae59ac69d5586d0d37"
      ],
      "title": "Have dissectors reduce rather than expand the protocol item length",
      "message": "Have dissectors reduce rather than expand the protocol item length\n\nAnalysis engines like MATE depend on dissectors which are uncertain\nof their PDU length up front to first declare the protocol item to\nspan the entire TVB, then at a later stage reduce their TVB scope.\n\nWith this change a few remaining dissectors not following this pattern\nare adjusted to work like this.\n",
      "author_name": "Jaap Keuter",
      "author_email": "jaap.keuter@xs4all.nl",
      "authored_date": "2025-12-27T11:45:51.000+01:00",
      "committer_name": "Jaap Keuter",
      "committer_email": "jaap.keuter@xs4all.nl",
